(text "J8 KEYED 2x10 DEBUG ONLY - NOT EURORACK POWER. No onboard MCU / no blink. D10 is ordinary +5V power indication.\n3.3 V external controller: inputs Hi-Z, outputs OPEN-DRAIN ONLY; no external pullups/power into AUX.\nNormal operation is hardware PG/window only; qualification JP1 stays OPEN. See docs/debug-interface.md for all pins and sequencing." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "37fad0a1-c9f4-5a1d-a2e2-f783fa9cee61"))
